        }
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": "Inverse of estleg:competentAuthority. Materialized at combined-build time from act-level authority edges so a consumer can ask which statutes an institution enforces without scanning the graph (#520). Range is rdfs:Resource so RDFS inference does not type the act objects as estleg:Act in the institutions SHACL bucket.",
