      "rdfs:comment": "Links an estleg:EUCourtDecision to an estleg:EULegislation node named in the decision label (CELEX/directive/regulation citation). Domain may be estleg:EUCourtDecision. Deliberately NO rdfs:range — objects are often bare estleg:EU_* stubs inside the curia SHACL bucket; a range would phantom-type them as EULegislation under inference=rdfs.",
