          "@value": "part of act",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "rdfs:comment": "IRI link from a provision, Chapter, or Subsection to its parent act root. owl:FunctionalProperty: a provision belongs to at most one act (issue #522). Combined materializes the transitive closure so lõiked carry the same edge as their parent § (#520). Distinct from the literal estleg:sourceAct title.",
